WEBVTT

00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:03.809
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:06.492
<v><b>A:</b></v> What phone do you have?

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.167
<v><b>B:</b></v> I have a Samsung.

00:00:10.518 --> 00:00:11.137
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:14.386
<v><b>A:</b></v> How many brothers and sisters do you have?

00:00:14.965 --> 00:00:16.346
<v><b>B:</b></v> I have two sisters.

00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:19.016
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:23.208
<v><b>A:</b></v> Which do you prefer, pizza or pasta?

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:25.100
<v><b>B:</b></v> Pizza, I think.

00:00:26.847 --> 00:00:27.585
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:29.634
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where do you work?

00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:32.152
<v><b>B:</b></v> In a restaurant near the river.

00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:34.420
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:35.459 --> 00:00:37.303
<v><b>A:</b></v> When do you have language classes?

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.746
<v><b>B:</b></v> On Mondays and Wednesdays.

00:00:42.595 --> 00:00:43.412
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:45.747
<v><b>A:</b></v> What kind of music do you like?

00:00:46.168 --> 00:00:47.906
<v><b>B:</b></v> I like pop and reggae.

00:00:49.469 --> 00:00:50.263
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:52.961
<v><b>A:</b></v> Who’s your favorite actor?

00:00:53.635 --> 00:00:55.445
<v><b>B:</b></v> Benedict Cumberbatch.

00:00:57.752 --> 00:00:58.411
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:00.444
<v><b>A:</b></v> Why do you like him?

00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:03.268
<v><b>B:</b></v> Because he’s a fantastic actor.